{"parse":{"title":"Winter's Last Offering","pageid":491547,"revid":2189650,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Winter&#39;s Last Offering</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Constellation_Winter%27s_Last_Offering.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031100\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Winter&#39;s Last Offering\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Constellation_Winter%27s_Last_Offering.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031100\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Constellation_Winter%27s_Last_Offering.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031100 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Constellation_Winter%27s_Last_Offering.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031100 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Winter&#39;s Last Offering\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Winter%27s_Last_Offering.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Winter&#39;s Last Offering.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kolo_of_Spring%27s_Arrival\" title=\"Kolo of Spring&#39;s Arrival\">Kolo of Spring's Arrival</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glory_to_Our_Forebears\" title=\"Glory to Our Forebears\">Glory to Our Forebears</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Increases the Level of the Elemental Skill <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">The Art of Victory</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">The Art of Victory</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Calls forth Spirit Blades passed down through generations of the Vila to deal <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>AoE Anemo DMG</b></span>, then switches to the Armed for Action mode and gains 2 stacks of Sword Essence mode.<br />Vesna can accumulate Sword Essence in the following ways:<br /><ul><li>By performing a Normal Attack, Charged Attack, or Plunging attack while in the Armed for Action mode, or by unleashing Windborne Sword: Transpose from the Constellation Unwavering Ardor;</li><li>By using the Elemental Skill The Art of Victory; or</li><li>By using the Elemental Burst For the Tsaritsa!.</li></ul><br /><br /><b>Armed for Action</b><br />DMG dealt by Vesna with her Normal Attacks, Charged Attacks, and Plunging Attacks become <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> that cannot be overridden by another elemental infusion instead. She will also summon a wind pinion that attacks the opponent at the same time, dealing additional <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>. Each time the wind pinion is summoned, Vesna will regenerate a certain amount of Sword Essence.<br />Vesna can consume Sword Essence to unleash the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword, which deals to the opponent <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>.<br />Each use of the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword in the same instance of Armed for Action will increase the level of Windborne Sword, beginning from Lv. 1 to Lv. 3 max, for more <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>. Using Windborne Sword at Lv. 2 and Lv. 3 will also summon Spirit Blades which deal <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>.<br />Vesna will exit the mode when its duration ends or when she has used Windborne Sword at the highest level 3 times. Exiting will clear all remaining Sword Essence she has accrued.<br />Additionally, when in this mode, Vesna's resistance to interruption is increased.<br />Radiance: Stellar Swirl: DMG dealt with the Spirit Blades becomes <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> that is also considered Stellar Swirl reaction DMG.</span></span></span> by 3.<br />Maximum upgrade level is 15.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Level_Increase\" title=\"Talent Level Increase\">Talent Level Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Skill_Level_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elemental Skill Level Increase\">Elemental Skill Level Increase</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Winter's Last Offering</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_3_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 3 Constellation\">Level 3 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FWinter%2527s_Last_Offering%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\